"Everything on the panel but the weather icon and the temperature: the "
"location, the condition and the readings. A percentage of the panel's "
"thickness."
msgstr ""
"Alles im Panel außer Wettersymbol und Temperatur: Standort, Wetterlage und "
"Messwerte. In Prozent der Panelstärke."

